User-defined stereotype DirectedAssociation with Shape Script is shown as a generalisation of the metaclass Association (via match) with the Direction then redefined. If you do this by inheriting from an Association with Direction set to Source -&amp;gt; Target and then multiple inheriting from match this causes the profile to have two different choices of arrow (plain association or Directed Association) where no choice is wanted..
